tion B: B, A, E, C, D.\n- Zhao Ming's prediction: E, D, C, A, B.\n  - Zhao Ming did not guess any correct positions (True).\n  - Zhao Ming did not guess any correct adjacent pairs (True).\n- Qian Liang's prediction: A, E, B, C, D.\n  - Qian Liang did not guess the correct position of any athlete (False).\n  - Qian Liang did not guess the correct order of any adjacent pairs (False).\n\n### Option C: E, D, A, B, C.\n- Zhao Ming's prediction: E, D, C, A, B.\n  - Zhao Ming did not guess any correct positions (False).Based on the analysis, **Option D: C, D, E, A, B** does not satisfy both Zhao Ming's and Qian Liang's conditions. Therefore, the correct ranking of the five sprinters is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
