with maintaining the agency.\n\nB) Has the cheese importation board, over the last several years, reduced its operating costs by eliminating inefficiencies within the agency itself?.\n- While this information could be useful in understanding the efficiency of the agency, it does not directly address the core argument about the health consequences and costs of not rejecting the one percent of cheese.\nThe possibility of having merchandise rejected by the cheese importation board does not deter many cheese exporters from shipping substandard cheese to Goronia. This information is not directly relevant to the core argument.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
