those who are paid a fixed hourly wage.\n- The context does not provide any information about the efficiency of the taxi drivers or how their payment method affects their efficiency.This option is not directly addressed by the context, so it is not strongly contradicted.Workers are unwilling to accept a lower hourly wage in exchange for the freedom to set their own schedules, according to the context which lacks such details.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
