messages:   80%|########  | 483/600 [04:42<00:22,  5.12it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nDivision is a logical method of dividing the objects reflected by a concept into several small categories to confirm the extension of the concept, or it can be said to be a logical method of dividing an extended generic concept into several juxtaposed species concepts. Decomposition is to divide an object into several parts in thinking, and there is not a species relationship between the concept that reflects the part and the concept that reflects the whole.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following options is correctly divided?\n# Options:\nA) The definition is divided into defined items, defined items and defined joint items.\nB) Hohhot is divided into xincheng district, huimin district, saihan district and yuquan district.\nC) Celestial bodies in the universe can be divided into natural and man-made celestial bodies.\nD) The penalty is divided into principal punishment, deprivation of political rights, confiscation of property, etc.', 'To solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to understand the definitions of "division" and "decomposition" provided in the context and then apply these definitions to the given options.\n\n1.**Division**: This is a logical method of dividing the objects reflected by a concept into several small categories to confirm the extension of the concept.It involves dividing a generic concept into several species concepts that are mutually exclusive and collectively exhaustive.\n\n2.**Decomposition**: This involves dividing an object into several parts in thinking, where there is not a species relationship between the concept that reflects the part and the concept that reflects the whole.\n\nNow, let\'s analyze each option:.The definition is united into undefined items, undefined items and undefined joint items. This option appears to be about the cohesion of a definition, and it is evident how these parts interconnect in terms of being inclusive and mutually exhaustive. It clearly fits the definition of unity.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
