nally to price changes.The statement that the price can be increased as much as possible is incorrect because it implies no impact on demand, which contradicts the definition of unitary elasticity.This option is incorrect.\n\n3.**Option C: The size of ep actually reflects the sensitivity of demand to cost changes.**.Based on the analysis, the incorrect statement is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
