messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe scene of mountains is beautiful after the rain, even if no one appreciates it.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is refuted by the above text?\n# Options:\nA) Beauty is only skin deep.\nB) The taste is uncountable.\nC) Beauty is only in the eyes of people.\nD) People just want to see what they like.', 'To solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s analyze the context and each option step by step.\n\nThe context states: "The scene of mountains is beautiful after the rain, even if no one appreciates it.".\n\nThis statement implies that beauty exists independently of whether people appreciate it or not.It suggests that beauty is an inherent quality of the scene, regardless of human perception.\n\nNow, let\'s examine each option:.\n\nA) Beauty is only skin deep.\n- This option talks about the superficiality of beauty, which is not directly related to the context.The context does not discuss the depth or superficiality of beauty.\n\nB) The taste is uncountable.\n- This option is about taste and its countability, which is irrelevant to the context.The context is about the beauty of a scene, not about taste.\nThe option that is supported by the context is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
