 - This is a fact already implied by the context (since all etching tools are either pin-tipped or bladed, not both).It does not directly support the conclusion about the number of engraving versus non-engraving tools.\n  .All etching tools that are not used for engraving are pin-tipped.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
