e sandwich layer.\n\nB) Professor zhang has never bought a house.he believes that buying a house is not as good as renting a house, and renting a house is not as good as borrowing a house.\n- This option describes a personal preference for not owning a house, rather than a financial or eligibility issue.It does not fit the definition of the sandwich layer.\n\nC) Lao liu used his life savings to buy a second-hand house with three bedrooms and one living room.Based on the analysis, the option that does not fit the definition of the sandwich layer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
