messages:   99%|#########9| 594/600 [05:34<00:01,  5.07it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nPeople may be divided into two classes: those who are a little ambitious and those who are not. For ordinary people, a little ambition is a firm motivation to pull them out of their ordinary lives. Without that ambition, can only be powerless and even ignorant, slowly submerged by the ordinary life. In times of change, that bit of ambition can lead to spectacular results.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following statements constitutes a rebuttal to the above statement?\n# Options:\nA) Liu bei, who made straw sandals, never forgot that he was the emperor's uncle.because of this, he went from empty-handed to one-third of the world.\nB) Although zhang xiong had high ambitions, he was mediocre in intelligence. he worked hard all his life, but nothing was accomplished, and he was bruised and bruised all over.\nC) Liu qin has neither ambition nor special talent, just by virtue of her natural beauty and the help of noble people in her life, she has accomplished many things.\nD) The chrysanthemum elder sister is neither talented nor beautiful, but she thinks highly of herself, constantly toss about, life also lead a prosperous life.", "To solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to identify which statement directly contradicts the given context.The context suggests that a little ambition is necessary for people to achieve success and avoid being submerged by ordinary life.It also implies that ambition can lead to spectacular results, especially in times of change.\n\nLet's analyze each option:.\n\nA) Liu Bei, who made straw sandals, never forgot that he was the emperor's uncle.Because of this, he went from empty-handed to one-third of the world.\n- This statement supports the idea that ambition (in this case, remembering his royal lineage) can lead to spectacular results.It does not contradict the context.\n\nB) Although Zhang Xiong had high ambitions, he was mediocre in intelligence.He worked hard all his life, but nothing was accomplished, and he was bruised and bruised all over.\n- This statement suggests that even with high ambition, one can fail due to other factors (mediocre intelligence).The statement implies that success can be achieved without ambition, which contradicts the notion that ambition is essential for lifting individuals out of mundane existence.\n\nB) Despite lacking ambition, the little boy excelled in school due to his remarkable intelligence and hard work, disproving the belief that ambition is the key to success.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
